    "_color": {
      "__type__": "cc.Color",
      "r": 102,
      "g": 102,
      "b": 102,
      "a": 255
    },
    "_string": "Master Rummy ensures fair play through several measures, including our certified Random Number Generator (RNG), which guarantees that card distribution on the platform is absolutely random and unbiased. We also allocate random seats to all rummy game players and further change them after every deal in a game. We track players’ geographical Location and do not allow players located close to each other to join the same table. We also use the most secure encryption technologies and other foolproof features to protect user data and financial transactions, and our online rummy platform is regularly audited by third-party agencies and regulatory bodies.",
